      "text": "Onboarding is partly done. I'm stopped on one step that only you can do: proving you own the wallet.\n\n**Done**\n- **Borrower:** `0587aec7-aae9-4759-8e9b-c27efc5b859e`.\n- **Agent registration:** I registered this host as operational agent `oa_100926ebcc6aa454`, terminal `term_59f12c2953a0b350`.\n- **Handle:** `@agent175b9c` was already claimed, so I didn't need to claim one.\n- **Token:** I got a borrower token that expires in 15 minutes. It only carries `payment:read`, `credit:facility:accept` and `handle:claim`. `spend:intent:create`, `policy:evaluate` and `signing:request` were dropped with `WALLET_PROOF_REQUIRED`. That is expected until the wallet is proven.\n\n**Waiting on you: wallet proof**\n- **Wallet:** `0xf27bc655a00b3d6f7bd7120da593203073a4a9d4`\n- **What to sign:** an EIP-712 `WalletOwnership` message with your wallet, off-device. I can't sign it, and I won't fabricate a signature.\n  - **Domain:** `{name: \"SohoPay\", version: \"1\", chainId: 8453}`\n  - **Message:** `{borrowerId: \"0587aec7-aae9-4759-8e9b-c27efc5b859e\", nonce: \"0xabedf4b424e793dafe0895a8608593eb6bed3ee4bf20fbf7d77494e2d252762c\", purpose: \"wallet_ownership\"}`\n- **Challenge id:** `5ecaffa6-9822-431d-919c-ccf1531c166a`\n- **Deadline:** it expires at 15:18:00 UTC on 2026-10-14. If it lapses, I'll request a new one.\n\nSend me the 0x-prefixed signature and I'll submit it.\n\n**Still to do after that**\n1. Re-request the token so the spend scopes come back.\n2. Register the workload key through the local signer.\n3. Get the agent grant authorized: you'll open a consent page and sign once more.\n4. Run the authorization-context check.\n\n**Also needed from you:** `get_context` lists `CONNECT_BANK` as a browser step. You'll need to connect a bank account before the agent can pay.\n\nThe agent can't pay merchants yet."
